{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":58,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["真正的禁食"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你要大声喊叫，不可止息；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扬起声来，好像吹角。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我百姓说明他们的过犯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向雅各家说明他们的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们天天寻求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乐意明白我的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像行义的国民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不离弃他们 神的典章，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我求问公义的判语，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喜悦亲近 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：我们禁食，你为何不看见呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们刻苦己心，你为何不理会呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，你们禁食的日子仍求利益，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勒逼人为你们做苦工。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们禁食，却互相争竞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以凶恶的拳头打人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们今日禁食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不得使你们的声音听闻于上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样禁食岂是我所拣选、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人刻苦己心的日子吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂是叫人垂头像苇子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用麻布和炉灰铺在他以下吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这可称为禁食、为耶和华所悦纳的日子吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我所拣选的禁食不是要松开凶恶的绳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解下轭上的索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使被欺压的得自由，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折断一切的轭吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是要把你的饼分给饥饿的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将飘流的穷人接到你家中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"见赤身的给他衣服遮体，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顾恤自己的骨肉而不掩藏吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，你的光就必发现如早晨的光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所得的医治要速速发明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的公义必在你前面行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的荣光必作你的后盾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时你求告，耶和华必应允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你呼求，他必说：我在这里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若从你中间除掉重轭","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和指摘人的指头，并发恶言的事，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你心若向饥饿的人发怜悯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使困苦的人得满足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的光就必在黑暗中发现；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的幽暗必变如正午。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华也必时常引导你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在干旱之地使你心满意足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骨头强壮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必像浇灌的园子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像水流不绝的泉源。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些出于你的人必修造久已荒废之处；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要建立拆毁累代的根基。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必称为补破口的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和重修路径与人居住的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["守安息日者的报赏"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你若在安息日掉转","poem":1},{"noteId":69},{"text":"你的脚步，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我圣日不以操作为喜乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"称安息日为可喜乐的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"称耶和华的圣日为可尊重的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且尊敬这日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不办自己的私事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不随自己的私意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不说自己的私话，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就以耶和华为乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华要使你乘驾地的高处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又以你祖雅各的产业养育你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华亲口说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":69,"caller":"-","text":"或译：谨慎","reference":{"chapter":58,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/58.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/59.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/57.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}